{"id":1060203,"name":"エンフェル・取り調べⅢ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"エンフェル・取り調べⅢ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1060203]}],"trial":{"trial_id":60203,"stage":"段階3","unlock_time":"2023-01-17 14:00:00","diary1":"エンフェルはあなたを連れて、屋敷の地下にあるアトリエに入った。その長い階段で、彼女があなたに違う物語を語る。\n　二世代に渡る芸術を支えた場所には、どんな真相が隠されているのだろう？","diary2":"エンフェルの作品は、全て壊されたわけではない。一つだけ、彼女の代表作がアトリエに残っている——それは彼女の恐怖の目覚め、そして恐怖の束縛である。\n　エンフェルが彫刻に刻まれたハートの印を見つけた時、不穏な力が再び溢れ、わずかに力の残っていた彫刻が再び……エンフェルを飲み込んだ。","evidence":[{"ID":260309,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260310,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":3,"dialogue_id":160203020,"next":[21]},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":160203023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"